	(text "K1 pole 1 (4 COM = AUDIO OUT): NC 6 = AUDIO IN (RX), NO 8 = GND -> AUDIO OUT grounded during PTT\nK1 pole 2 (13 COM = PTT OUT): NO 9 = GND -> PTT OUT grounded during PTT (dry contact)\nRelay coils switched low-side by Q8 (IRF3708, ~75 mA); D10 = flyback"
