	)
	(text "TX : Q1 on  -> R1-L1-D1-L2-L4-D2-Q1 conducts: D1 + D2 ON\n     Q11 shorts Q3 gate: Q3 off -> R3 feeds the RF-derived HT (~2 x RF peak) to RXN: D3 OFF\nRX : Q1 off, Q3 on (gate via R20) -> R1-L1-D3-L3-Q3 conducts: D3 ON (HT ~0 V without RF)\n     R2 holds the D1 cathode at +12 V: D1 reverse biased"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 189.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "77152136-ed4d-49fc-9cbe-ccfa999c876a")
	)
	(text "RF-derived bias: HT ~ 2 x RF peak during TX (D22 clamps ~220 V), ~0 V in RX"
