		(uuid "dff0ee49-5dc4-4f75-9902-e7c8d0502a47")
	)
	(text "Fast detector C20/C21 (1:11, flat 1.8-50 MHz) -> D8 -> VDET\nU3 LM311: DET low < 1 us after VDET > THR (RV1) -> D15 pulls TXL low (instant TX)\nRF without PTT: DET also discharges HOLD via Q13/D17/R24 -> U2A keeps TX ~10 s after the last RF,\n   U2B lights D16 RF SENSED for the same time. C12 to +12V so power-up starts in RX with LED off.\nPTT inhibit: Q13 gate = PTT_IN via R36/C44 (D18 fast off) -> no hold during PTT + ~20 ms after release\nQ10 (2N7000) inverts TXL -> TX (pull-up R34)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 290.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e0c2842-7a8d-417c-bb66-5c6e4c1b21fa")
	)
